MainWindow *-- Menu : contiene
Menu --> SignalsWindow
Menu --> KeyboardWindow
Menu --> TrainWindow
Menu --> SerialConfiguration
Menu --> CaptureWindow
Menu --> SpellerConfigurationWindow
Menu --> RecordingShowedWindow
Menu --> ControllerSerialConfig
Menu --> ControllerKeyboardCapture
Menu --> controllerSaveCapture
Menu --> PredictorController

SignalsWindow o-- SerialReader : crea/controla
SignalsWindow o-- EmotivReader : crea/controla
SignalsWindow o-- PlottingThread : crea/controla
SignalsWindow o-- RecordingThread : crea/controla
EmotivReader --> EmotivPacketDecoder : decodifica
PlottingThread --> EEGFilter
RecordingThread --> EEGFilter

SerialConfiguration ..> ControllerSerialConfig : configura
ControllerSerialConfig --> SignalsWindow : aplica puerto/baudrate

KeyboardWindow *-- OutputLine : contiene
ControllerKeyboardCapture --> KeyboardWindow : flash / hide

CaptureWindow ..> ControllerKeyboardCapture : captura / flash
CaptureWindow ..> controllerSaveCapture : almacenamiento
controllerSaveCapture --> SignalsWindow : EEG grabado[cite: 5, 6]
ControllerKeyboardCapture --> KeyboardWindow

SpellerConfigurationWindow ..> PredictorController : prediccion online
SpellerConfigurationWindow ..> controllerSaveCapture : trial UNKNOWN
SpellerConfigurationWindow --> KeyboardWindow : paradigma ajedrez
PredictorController --> HierarchicalBCIPredictor : inferencia
HierarchicalBCIPredictor --> EEGFeatureExtractor : caracteristicas

TrainWindow *-- TrainingThread : crea
TrainWindow *-- ChannelMapWidget : canales
ChannelMapWidget *-- ChannelNodeCheckBox
TrainWindow ..> controllerTraining : inicia entrenamiento
TrainingThread --> controllerTraining : train_model(**args)
controllerTraining --> SafeLDA
controllerTraining --> HierarchicalTrainer
HierarchicalTrainer --> EEGFeatureExtractor
HierarchicalTrainer --> SafeLDA

